TITL CrystalPilot n0023 in P 6/m m m
REM CrystalPilot node n0023 tool=run_shelxl
REM R1 = 0.0853 wR2 = 0.2563 GooF = 0.913
CELL 0.68883 39.19000 39.19000 16.61000 90.0000 90.0000 120.0000
ZERR 3 0.00000 0.00000 0.00000 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000
LATT 1
SYMM X-Y,X,Z
SYMM Y,-X+Y,Z
SYMM -Y,X-Y,Z
SYMM -X+Y,-X,Z
SYMM X-Y,-Y,-Z
SYMM -X,-X+Y,-Z
SYMM -X,-Y,Z
SYMM Y,X,-Z
SYMM -Y,-X,-Z
SYMM -X+Y,Y,-Z
SYMM X,X-Y,-Z
SFAC C H O Zr
REM DISP lambda 0.68883 A is not a SHELXL built-in line (Cu/Mo/Ag K-alpha):
REM DISP f'/f'' from cctbx (sasaki: C O Zr; henke: H), mu = NIST attenuation
REM DISP in barn/atom
DISP $C 0.002 0.002 10.99
DISP $H 0.000 0.000 0.62
DISP $O 0.007 0.006 30.28
DISP $Zr -9.041 2.772 14341.91
UNIT 264.0 132.0 96.0 18.0

EQIV $1 -X+1, -Y+1, Z
EQIV $2 X, Y, -Z+1
EQIV $3 -X+1, -Y+1, -Z+1
FREE ZR1 ZR2
FREE ZR1 ZR2_$1
FREE ZR1 ZR2_$2
FREE ZR1 ZR2_$3
FREE ZR2 ZR2_$1
FREE ZR2 ZR2_$2
FREE ZR2 ZR1_$3

SHEL 999 1.000

SADI 0.020 C2 C5 C5 C3 C3 C4 C4 C8 C8 C11 C11 C2
SADI 0.040 C2 C3 C5 C4 C3 C8 C4 C11 C8 C2 C11 C5
FLAT 0.02 C2 C5 C3 C4 C8 C11
FLAT 0.02 C6 C7 C9 C10 C12
FLAT 0.02 O1 O2 C1 C4
RIGU 0.0040 0.0040 O1 O2 C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8 C9 C10 C11 C12

REM CrystalPilot: solvent-mask Fourier coefficients in final.fab
REM (the same .fab file the SHELXL job used)
